OL,5,G1330 Car Pound Cops
OL,6,     FIn Northamptonshire, Matt collects
OL,7,     Fan untaxed vehicle with four
OL,8,     Fpunctured tyres from a residential
OL,9,     Farea, and officers stop a car
OL,10,     Fwhose driver and passengers are
OL,11,     Fnot wearing seatbelts. (Ep7)
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FThe interceptors catch a gang of
OL,14,     Fcar thieves red-handed. Officers
OL,15,     Fclamp down on car crime at Essex's
OL,16,     Fbiggest shopping centre.
OL,17,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FA massive manhunt ensues after
OL,19,     Fthree suspects flee into a farm.
OL,20,     FThe team raids a drugs den, and
OL,21,     Fofficers stumble across a
OL,22,     Fsuspicious-looking postman.
